{"resourceIdentifier":"5336","resourceName":"Shaoyang Xinning LFG Power Generation Project","description":"The Shaoyang Xinning Landfill Gas Power Generation Project (hereinafter referred to as the Project) is a landfill gas (LFG) recovery and utilization project located at the Laohutuo Landfill in Hengqiao Village, Wantang Town, Xinning County, Shaoyang City, Hunan Province, P.R. China.\r\nBefore the implementation of the project activity, the LFG generated from the Laohutuo Landfill was released into the atmosphere; the equivalent amount of electricity generated by the project activity was supplied by the fossil-fuel-dominated Central China Power Grid (CCPG). The baseline scenario is the same as the conditions existing prior to the implementation of the project activity. Greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions will be reduced by avoiding CO2 emissions from those fossil fuel-based power plants connected to the grid and by avoiding GHG emissions from releasing LFG into the atmosphere at the landfill site.","location":{"latitude":26.494278,"longitude":110.826261},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2025-02-03","endExclusive":"2025-03-06","endInclusive":"2025-03-05"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5336"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hunan"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Xinning Xinzhongshui Bio-energy Power Generation Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Hu'nan Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"37355"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":